 "text": "Reference\nAudit Observations\nAudit Recommendatlons\n3.16.1.3 Appraise and assess the RPUs not\nIncluded in the Assessment Roll and submit\ncoples of tax declaration as proof appraisal\n/ and assessment;\n3.16.1.4. Review other tax maps not Included\nIn the sample to ensure that RPUs inscribed\ntherein are included in the AR; and\n3.16.1.5. Henceforth, ascertain that RPUs in\nthe tax maps are Included in the AR.\n3.16.2. The Office of the City Treasurer\ncharge and collect from taxpayers the\namount of P3,336,539.51 that were under\nImposed in CY 2023 due to erroneous\napplication of the Assessment Level, and\nhenceforth, ensure that correct amount of\ntaxes is Imposed/collected.\nAGENCY ACTION PLAN\nStatus of\nPerson/Dept.\nTarget Implementation Date\nAction Plan\nImplementation\nResponsible\nFrom\nTo\nReason for Partial/Delay/\nNon-Implementation, if\napplicable\nOffice of the City\nAssessor\n2024\n2024 Ongoing\nOffice of the City\nAssessor\n2024\n2024 Ongoing\nOffice of the City\nAssessor\n2024\nCTO\n2024\n2024 Ongoing\n2024 Ongoing\nAction Taken/Action to\nbe Taken\nThe City Assessor Office\nis currently reviewing\nthe assessment levels\nof the purposes of\nproper RPT and SET\nImposition\nThe City Assessor Office\nis currently reviewing\nthe assessment levels\nof the purposes of\nproper RPT and SET\nImposition\nThe City Assessor Office\nIs currently rovlewing\nthe assessment levels\nof the purposes of\nproper RPT and SET\nImposition\nThe City Assessor Office\nIs currently revlewing\nthe assessment levels\nof the purposes of\nproper RPT and SET\nImposition. Once the\nreview of the\nAssessment Levels Is\ndone, the CTO will\ncollect the tax\ndeficlencles.\n",
